# Primitive — Hecksagon
#
# Persistence (i728 step 2 : make the implicit explicit, behavior-preserving).
# The Process aggregate records one process-spawn side-effect per row (ok,
# output, exit_code, audit) and persists across boots today
# (information/primitive/process.heki). It reached heki via the implicit
# default ; :heki is declared here so the backing is EXPLICIT before the
# default flips to memory. Pairs with primitive.bluebook.
#
Hecks.hecksagon "Primitive" do
  adapter :heki
end
